This synthetic training reference summarizes the controlled Product Alpha check at IP-03.

Before measuring: clean the part and caliper jaws, then confirm the gage returns to zero.
During measurement: use gentle contact at the specified width; do not measure across burrs.
Acceptance: compare the result with the nominal requirement using the ±0.18 mm band.
Recording: capture the sample alias, actual millimetre value, gage status, and PASS or HOLD.

If a reading is outside the band or the gage does not hold zero, stop movement of the sample and use the NCR-026 containment workflow. Quality disposition is required before release.

